Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(intelligence-qa): eliminate
 constant/fallback-fabricated metrics in regional aggregation,
 recommendations, early-warning (IQA-09..IQA-11)

Rule applied per QA directive: any metric produced from a constant/fallback
without a real measurement basis is a defect until proven otherwise.
Adversarial sweep of all ?? <num> / || <num> fallbacks across 21 engines.

IQA-09 regional-intelligence-network (EI-10, regional aggregation):
- summarizeRegionalHealth: no-data schools no longer fabricate 90.0 attendance /
  15.0 GPA into regional means; averages computed only over schools with real
  metrics (null when none); no-data schools counted as NO_DATA (was: HEALTHY);
  data_coverage + no_data_schools_count added.
- buildRegionalSnapshot: resolution_rate ??100.0 and chronic ??5.0 removed
  (null-aware means); PURE-CONSTANT metrics eliminated:
  effective_interventions_ratio (was hardcoded 0.85/1.0) and
  average_difficulty_p_value (was hardcoded 0.62/0.65) -> null + NOT_MEASURED;
  fabricated regional peak day 'wednesday' -> null when unmeasured.

IQA-10 recommendation-action-planning (EI-13, recommendation):
- generateActionRecommendations: rules fire only on measured signals; fabricated
  evidence eliminated (chronic ??14.2/5.0, attendance ??90.0, gpa ??15.0,
  failing ??0.05). Recommendation evidence now carries only real values
  (regression pin: 70% real attendance fires with chronic=null, not 14.2).
- evaluateActionEffectiveness: deltas only when pre-metric actually measured
  (was: fabricated baselines 85/12/14/60 producing fake deltas);
  zero measured deltas -> efficacy NOT_MEASURABLE; measured_deltas_count added.

IQA-11 intervention-case-management (EI-08, early-warning):
- evaluateEarlyWarningRules: fake-healthy defaults (gpa ??15.0,
  attendance ??100.0) no longer SUPPRESS warnings; rules with unmeasured inputs
  are skipped, real signals still fire (70% attendance alerts with unknown GPA).
- createInterventionCase: fabricated baselines gpa ??10.0 / attendance ??85.0 -> null.
- evaluateInterventionOutcome: deltas require real baseline; no baseline ->
  NOT_MEASURABLE + ESTABLISH_BASELINE_METRICS (was: fake deltas vs 10.0/85.0).

Battery extended with PART D (14 new pins): 263/263.
Regression: semantic-layer 33/33, run.js 35/35, smoke 547/547, api 31/31.
